transparency sprite-blit) is dispatched with NO args -> 294d resolves a GARBAGE sprite id -> SIGSEGV in
298a (the recurring dropped-indirect-arg class).

ROOT CAUSE (asm-verified vs re_out/fist_dat_image.bin @ image 0x165c2..0x165e9 = FUN_1000_65c2 head;
OBSERVED reached on the genuine BATTLES(160,100)->OK(205,128)->ACCEPT(40,186) AZER1 run once patch 295's
